# GXDE desktop metapackage: pulls in the split purpose-based packages.
# Version follows gxde-control-center (same as the historical bundle).
Name:           gxde-core
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        @RELEASE@%{?dist}
Summary:        GXDE OS desktop core components set (metapackage)
License:        GPL-3.0-or-later
URL:            https://github.com/GXDE-OS
BuildArch:      noarch

Requires:       gxde-artwork gxde-libs gxde-daemon gxde-polkit-agent
Requires:       gxde-dock gxde-top-panel gxde-control-center gxde-launcher
Requires:       gxde-session-ui gxde-file-manager gxde-terminal gxde-search
Requires:       gxde-screensaver gxde-compressor gxde-installer
Requires:       gxde-app-management
Requires:       gxde-wallpaper-chooser
Recommends:     lightdm accountsservice gxde-display-manager flakewm

%description
Metapackage for the GXDE OS desktop core components, split into
purpose-based packages: artwork/themes, internal libraries, session
daemons, polkit agent, dock, top panel, control center, launcher,
session UI, file manager, terminal, search, screensaver, compressor,
installer translations, app management and the wallpaper chooser. Mirrors the Arch
gxde-core-git package set.

# Empty metapackage; rpm6 silently produces no binary RPM without a %files
# section (exit 0, nothing written).
%files

%changelog
* Tue Oct 20 2026 CharOfString <root@charofstring.cc> - @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
- Split the gxde-core bundle into purpose-based packages for Fedora 44 and 45
